<newsitem itemid="515774" id="root" date="1997-04-17" xml:lang="en">
<title>USA: CDW Computer Centers Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>CDW Computer Centers Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months</p>
<p>							   Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales				     $297,777	$206,705</p>
<p> Cost of sales				  257,834	 180,058</p>
<p> Gross profit				    39,943	  26,647</p>
<p> Selling and administrative expenses     22,027	  14,356</p>
<p> Exit charge					   --	   4,000</p>
<p> Income from operations			17,916	   8,291</p>
<p> Interest income, net			     957	     835</p>
<p> Other expense				     (51)	    (54)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		  18,822	   9,072</p>
<p> Income tax provision			   7,463	   3,538</p>
<p> Net income					11,359	   5,534</p>
<p> Net income per share			    0.52	    0.26</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		     21,682	  21,648</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: All share amounts reflect a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend paid on July 15, 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1996 earnings include a $3.2 million pretax charge, including a $4 million non-recurring charge, for exiting the company's facility, and a related $800,000 reduction in the executive bonus pool. Pro forma net income and EPS, excluding the impact of the exit charge and its related impact on the executive incentive bonus pool were $11.8 million and $0.55 per share for Q1 1997 and $7.5 million and $0.35 per share for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
